LinkModule Dependency_tracker
Title: Dependency Tracker
Description: This module is useful when you need to track dependencies that span  modules.  It changes the bevel style of nodes that depend on an ancestor node and influence a descendant node.  This makes it possible to visually track the path of dependency throughout the model.~
~
As variations on this, it is also possible to bevel all nodes that are ancestors of a given node, or all nodes that are descendants of a given node.  Thus, there are three types of dependency displays possible.~
~
To use, fill in the identifiers for greatest_ancestor and greatest_descendant.
