Function Has_bevel(node : variable)
Title: Has bevel
Description: returns true if the bevel is set for node.
Definition: if IsNull(nodeinfo of node) then false~
else (~
  var ni := Split(nodeinfo of node,',');~
  if size(ni)>9 then Slice(ni,9)='1' else false~
)
