Function Isatomicundef(x)
Title: IsAtomicUndef
Description: Returns true if x is an atomic undef or null.  If x is a list or array, returns false, or if it is atomic with anything other than null or undefined, returns false.
Definition: IsNotSpecified(if x=null then undefined else x)
