Function Mark_descendants_of(node : atomic handle orNull; mark : atomic coerce text)
Title: Mark Descendants Of
Description: Sets the DependencyMark attribute to mark for all outputs of node, or outputs of those, etc.
Definition: if node=null then 0~
else if DependencyMark of node=mark then 0~
else (~
  DependencyMark of node := mark;~
  Mark_descendants_of(outputs of node,mark);~
  Mark_descendants_of(dynoutputs of node,mark)~
);~
0
