Recursive: 1

Function Bevel_marked_ancesto(node : atomic handle orNull; mark : coerce atomic text )
Title: Bevel Marked Ancestors Of
Description: Sets the bevel on node or any ancestor of node for which DependencyMark is mark.
Definition: if node=null then 0~
else if Has_bevel(Handle(node)) then 0~
else (~
  if DependencyMark of node = mark then  Set_Node_Bevel(Handle(node),1);~
  Bevel_marked_ancesto(inputs of node,mark);~
  Bevel_marked_ancesto(dyninputs of node,mark)~
);~
0
NodeLocation: 432,240,1
